'''Silver''' (Japanese: '''シルバー''' ''Silver'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Your opponent reveals their hand. Choose a Supporter card you find there and shuffle it into your opponent's deck.
}}

