==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to the effect of the {{TCG|Rocket's Sneak Attack}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but it can only shuffle {{TCGP|Supporter card}}s back into the opponent's deck instead of any Trainer card.
===Origin===
*{{ga|Silver}} is the [[rival]] character of {{game5|Gold|Silver|Crystal|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}.

